# Ukrainian "yesterday".  Both spellings are standard: the entry heads
# "учора" and lists "вчора" as an alternative form, the ordinary у-/в-
# alternation.  Source: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/учора.
# "учора" is also what CLDR dateFields gives for locale "uk", day
# relative-type--1.
вчора
учора
